{
"Items.FlameheartSpear.Desc": "This exquisite gold and black spear occasionally pulses with thin sprites of orange and red. This weapon deals more damage the closer you are to death.\n<i>Inquisitors fought a hopeless war, and were taught that valor and courage shines brightest against a backdrop of despair.</i> "
"Items.FlameheartSpear.Long": "a flameheart spear"
"Items.FlameheartSpear.Short": "F.Heart Spear"
}
